profile_error.description:
The {integration} integration describes its devices for HomeKit, but on bridge {bridge} that description failed:

{problems}

Those devices still appear in HomeKit using the bridge's own mapping. If you develop {integration}, the `hap_bridge.preview` action shows what HomeKit gets for a device. Otherwise, report this to the integration's authors.

shim_error.description:
The shim {shim} ({origin}) describes devices for HomeKit, but on bridge {bridge} it failed:

{problems}

Those devices still appear in HomeKit without it. Fix the shim, check it with the `hap_bridge.preview` action, then reload the bridge.

start_failed.description:
The bridge could not start, so its accessories are unavailable in HomeKit.

Error: {error}

Check the log for details, then reload the integration.
